       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPUTEROUNDED.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRICE      PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 19.99.
       01 QTY        PIC 9(2)    VALUE 3.
       01 TAX-RATE   PIC 9V999   VALUE 0.075.
       01 TOTAL      PIC 9(4)V99.
       01 TOTAL-INT  PIC 9(4).
       01 SHOW-TOTAL PIC Z,ZZ9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE TOTAL ROUNDED = PRICE * QTY * (1 + TAX-RATE)
           MOVE TOTAL TO SHOW-TOTAL
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " SHOW-TOTAL
           COMPUTE TOTAL-INT ROUNDED = PRICE * QTY
           DISPLAY "ROUNDED INTEGER: " TOTAL-INT
           STOP RUN.
